**Key Findings extracted:**
- **Study Identification**: Liu et al., 2024, *Progress in Neuropsychopharmacology & Biological Psychiatry*.
- **Datasets**: A single-site clinical dataset (Zhengzhou University) was used.
- **Normative Model**: Trained on 104 healthy controls (Mean Age: 23.14, SD: 5.64; 49.04% Male) using Gaussian process regression on functional connectivity strength (FCS) features.
- **Clinical Application**: The model was applied to 99 patients with OCD to identify two distinct neurophysiological subtypes.
